  "content": "\n\n<h1>Tim Core</h1>\n<p>v1.7.3-1.31</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/timinc-cobble/cobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p>\n<h2>如果……</h2>\n<p>……我的 Cobblemon 模組能在不用大量複製貼下的情況下正常運作嗎？</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractMod-2fb57e0d4afd817b8612d3e4449956bf%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbstractMod</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractConfig-2fb57e0d4afd816b8d8fcb15b09c0f8a%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbstractConfig</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fConfigBuilder-2fb57e0d4afd815385a0f62746dc3a32%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ConfigBuilder</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fOverridable-Options-2fb57e0d4afd811f8a10e56d2dad718e%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可覆寫選項</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractHandler-2fb57e0d4afd813fb883fd539053be04%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbstractHandler</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fDebugger-2fb57e0d4afd815c817de32f57e5c0be%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">除錯工具</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonExtensions-2fb57e0d4afd81a98ed6d0b2bfd56421%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PokemonExtensions</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fEvents-2fb57e0d4afd81dd9c39d8c954a28420%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">事件系統</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCustom-Pok-mon-Properties-2fb57e0d4afd81c4a4bed69179471d09%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂寶可夢屬性</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fHoldings-2fb57e0d4afd81aaa359e1948d19988e%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">持有物品</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fExpAll-Logic-2fb57e0d4afd8195be3bd2ebbd5239b7%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗共享邏輯</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawning-Buckets-Attachment-2fb57e0d4afd813c96f7cbb8e6924c16%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成桶附加功能</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawn-Cause-Attachment-2fb57e0d4afd8126bf67e5f526098552%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成原因附加功能</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonMatcher-2fb57e0d4afd819180aee50ae705c795%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>PokemonMatcher</code></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fResourceReloadListeners-2fb57e0d4afd810ba3fee0a59207e060%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>ResourceReloadListeners</code></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fBlock-Item-Registration-2fb57e0d4afd81979b18e8fccc978a57%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊與物品註冊</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCommands-2fb57e0d4afd81ceb2adfc24b1377050%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">指令</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fLimited-List-2fb57e0d4afd81a28e56e48ee96857cf%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">限制清單</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fWild-Pok-mon-Reservation-System-2fb57e0d4afd814fb925ecc9593d9565%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">野生寶可夢預留系統</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonRepresentation-2fb57e0d4afd81c1881cd894f12b8854%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PokemonRepresentation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fBase-Cobblemon-Fixes-2fb57e0d4afd8147a428e845cd42b6d8%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基礎 Cobblemon 修復</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPrevent-Spawns-2fb57e0d4afd8193b767d9023288b7c0%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">防止生成</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawning-Influences-2fb57e0d4afd8127a8c9c78fffb629fb%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成影響因素</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCustom-Property-Extractor-2fb57e0d4afd819c9a21d526d7591634%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂屬性提取器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCodecs-2fb57e0d4afd81e49bc5d746c1c10c8b%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Codecs</a></p>\n<h2>玩家說明</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fConfig-Options-2fb57e0d4afd81d1ac7de074d314d790%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定選項</a></p>\n<h2>相依模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCobblemon-22157e0d4afd80a49896c70a775a3c7f%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>已知問題</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>≤v1.7.1-1.29.0 版本不知何故在同時存在白名單與黑名單時，將 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fLimited-List-27a57e0d4afd80b68ae3c0613e8e6ca7%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">限制清單</a> 的邏輯設為「或」。這意味著你可以選擇通過白名單或跳過黑名單，但這有點不合理。你通常希望能夠指定類似「所有電屬性，但不包含隱藏特性」的條件，這需要該條件同時符合白名單且不在黑名單中。此問題已於 1.7.1-1.29.1 修正。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>開發路線圖</h2>\n<p>若您想追蹤本模組的最新開發進度，請加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWKAR27SdSv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 並訂閱該內容頻道的通知。您也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fTim-Core-22057e0d4afd809b9c02e78f26805376%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組主頁</a> 上查看待辦事項清單。</p>\n<h2>意見回饋</h2>\n<p>如果您對本模組有任何問題、建議，或只是想來打個招呼，歡迎前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWKAR27SdSv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>！</p>\n<h2>贊助支援</h2>\n<p>如果您喜歡我製作的內容，或曾藉此協助您完成專案，歡迎考慮 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftimsminecraftmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">贊助一杯咖啡</a>！若願意提及我是如何幫助您的，將不勝感激！</p>",
